OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Four Winds
Description	Four keepers, four identical corners, one crossroads. Quarter turn symmetric, so no corner is better than another. 4 players. A hero company holds 4 keeps in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

